```
ROLE: product_realist  VOTE: yellow
REAL_USE_CASE: LLM pretraining data curation teams (e.g., Dolma/Pile/C4 builders) and eval-safety teams auditing benchmark contamination before model release, who currently rely on document-level near-dedup (MinHash-LSH per Lee et al. 2021) and need to know if short embedded benchmark spans are missed.
OPERATIONAL_SIGNIFICANCE: Microbenchmark-only until L1 validates on real corpora. L0 demonstrates a mathematically sound mechanism (union-normalized Jaccard ≈0.09 for 50-in-500 tokens, below any usable threshold) yielding 100% miss gap for verbatim short spans (span_ratio≤0.1) with doc-level recall 0.00 vs passage recall 1.00, and a material under-count (true 20% → reported 0%). However, the gap collapses under paraphrase≥0.2 (passage also misses), and L0 provides no evidence that real-world corpora (Pile/C4/Dolma vs MMLU/GSM8K/HellaSwag) contain >20% contamination via verbatim short spans rather than paraphrased text. Passage-level n-gram checks (GPT-3 13-gram, PaLM 8-gram) are already standard practice, so the "win" is a quantified measurement, not a new deployable capability.
ADOPTION_BARRIER: [Computational cost of passage-level n-gram matching at billion-doc scale vs MinHash-LSH (though GPT-3/PaLM prove feasibility); threshold calibration requires held-out innocent quote set to achieve precision 1.0 at span_thresh~0.95 (low thresholds over-flag innocent 90% quotes with precision 0.55-0.57); gap is verbatim-only—paraphrased contamination requires semantic methods, limiting scope; if teams already run n-gram checks, adoption is a reporting-practice change, not a new tool; novelty risk: the quantified gap may be folklore ("n-gram finds more than dedup") without sufficient rate-distortion novelty to change production practice]
RATIONALE: L0 FINDINGS (A) show doc-level recall 0.00 even at Jaccard≥0.3 for span_ratio≤0.1, passage recall 1.00, miss gap ~100% (packet L0 FINDINGS, RESULTS table). (B) confirms true 20% → doc-level reports 0%, passage-level recovers 20% at perfect precision when span_thresh~0.95 (packet L0 FINDINGS, RESULTS section B; precision table shows 1.00 at 0.95 vs 0.55-0.57 at low thresholds). HONEST NEGATIVE BOUNDARY states gap collapses under paraphrase≥0.2 (packet, RESULTS verdict). NOVELTY FRAMING and PRIOR-ART CAVEAT cite GPT-3 13-gram, PaLM 8-gram, Lee et al. 2021 as published standard practice, establishing that n-gram checks exist and the contribution is the measured gap, not the method. WHAT A REAL L1 SHOULD MEASURE explicitly calls for real corpus shards vs real benchmarks and paraphrase distribution measurement, acknowledging L0 does not establish operational frequency (packet). ORCHESTRATOR NOTE warns to converge if the gap is already-known folklore or verbatim-only scope is too narrow (packet).
```
